menu "ESP-NN tests"
   depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32P4

config NN_TEST_PIE_CONTEXT_SECONDS
   int "Two-task PIE context test duration (seconds)"
   range 0 3600
   default 10
   help
      How long esp_nn_pie_context_test() runs two PIE tasks on one core.
      0 skips the test.

config NN_TEST_PIE_CONTEXT_IRQ_US
   int "Extra timer interrupt period during the PIE context test (us)"
   range 0 100000
   default 10
   help
      Period of a GPTimer interrupt on the core under test, so interrupts
      also land inside the hardware loops. 0 turns it off; the task time
      slicing (tick interrupt) still preempts the tasks.
endmenu
